d Siamak Shakeri and Xinyi Wu and Jaehoon Lee and Kevin Gimpel and Stefano Ermon and Yufang Hou and Sepideh Sadeghi and Diyi Yang and Chris Callison-Burch and Christian Voigt and Fernando Martínez-Plumed and Tao Li and Thomas Phan and Svetlana Kiritchenko and James Zou and Daniel Khashabi and John Miller and Katja Markert and Peter Eckersley and Benno Stein and Ruslan Salakhutdinov and Ronan Le Bras and Dong-Ho Lee and Sayan Ghosh and Gregor Betz and Siva Reddy and Xiaoyu Tong and Aditya Gupta and Tao Yu and Andrew M. Dai and Emanuele Rodolà and Stephanie Lin and Gerard de Melo and Nicholas Cameron and Saif M. Mohammad and Deep Ganguli and Deniz Yuret and Gaurav Mishra and Tariq Ali and Tushar Khot and Yangqiu Song and Andreas Stuhlmüller and Rui Zhang and Ekin Dogus Cubuk and Eric Chu and Elizabeth Barnes and Steve Piantadosi and Vera Demberg and Sebastian Schuster and Erkut Erdem and Jelle Bosscher and Theodore Rothschild and Jennifer Marsh and Janelle Wingfield and Xiang Ren and Joseph Boudeman and Ramon Risco and Hannah Kim and Shyamolima (Shammie) Debnath and Dilyar Buzan and Cindy Ramirez and Mike Cain and Zachary Seid and Cameron Dour and Cedrick Argueta and Parth Doshi and Dylan Schrader and Jonathan Batchelder and Timofei Kornev and Fanyue Xia and Sriharsha Hatwar and Lucas Lam and Mátyás Schubert and Courtney Ashcraft and Rahel Habacker and Elizabeth Donoway and Neta Gur-Ari Krakover and Joan Waweru and Daniel Moseguí González and Francesca Happé and Kristen Chiafullo and Titus Tunduny and Nicole Martinez and Katerina Ignatyeva and Bryan Orinion and Eunice Engefu Manyasi and Nuan Wen and B. Ryan Roberts and Rowan Jacobs and Joyce Chua and Danielle Perszyk and Vivek Srikumar and Mitch Walker and Kevin Omondi and Tatsu Hashimoto and Tianle Wang and Stefan Divic and Emma Lam and Omar Elbaghdadi and Sarah A. Rous and Batuhan Özyurt and Michael Gu and Tiberius Nkinyili and Hayden Bogar and David Drakard and Marco Baturan and John U. Balis and Nick Doiron and St